astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GbhqONRWT8IQ7kNvwGfgvic&_nc_oc=Adken5kwAJxLhxd9HSuXjbMtSlr2ckW5WV7wzaWh2ShwrhX75nRUyp4vfYpb7bUkRF8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsCqA8A8qKO3U5QmXZIeTIuwUKufbQqURLxI6oeJ_DWpQ&oe=699AE0F3"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Wa65ed4HQsQ7kNvwG_fsDl&_nc_oc=Adkb3_Tgc7OB5tcmzghqogvcUD5tocJnV_uiVeqGLkb9bEZgIujAL-PrcxWpz5m0kfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvMnOBD9NuJNtN6mAC4x-67y2fDd_2-yaIl-Z1PlkaV1w&oe=699AE196"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7zF-jgFYkIQQ7kNvwGdG5kq&_nc_oc=AdnESoPTFuPtLMBaI1oufqy476r4CiRGoTvWzhtg4JhekUInV9bdgNrfxhJ8P-zw3bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvGNdKsY4LkRyt_hxrMKsiDzdn0kU_M6Vx2MxSKXTJWUw&oe=699B003D"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip